        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punch zombies. Fill your shopping list. Race to checkout before your rivals or the clock takes you out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Checkout Blitz: The Shopping Dead</i> is an arcade-style game where you’re a courier shopper ripping through zombie-infested aisles. Each chaotic run drops you into a new store layout packed with hazards, power-ups, and absurd shopping lists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo, partner up in co-op, or clash in versus mode. Level up your shopper class, unlock new upgrades, and turn mundane retail into mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to pick up. Chaotic to master. Just don’t forget: <strong>dead shoppers don’t get refunds.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621760/extras/82f42fa4a466ba1109320fe11f46ee60.poster.avif?t=1787708313\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621760/extras/82f42fa4a466ba1109320fe11f46ee60.webm?t=1787708313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621760/extras/82f42fa4a466ba1109320fe11f46ee60.mp4?t=1787708313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punch zombies. Fill your shopping list. Race to checkout before your rivals or the clock takes you out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Checkout Blitz: The Shopping Dead</i> is an arcade-style game where you’re a courier shopper ripping through zombie-infested aisles. Each chaotic run drops you into a new store layout packed with hazards, power-ups, and absurd shopping lists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo, partner up in co-op, or clash in versus mode. Level up your shopper class, unlock new upgrades, and turn mundane retail into mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to pick up. Chaotic to master. Just don’t forget: <strong>dead shoppers don’t get refunds.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621760/extras/82f42fa4a466ba1109320fe11f46ee60.poster.avif?t=1787708313\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621760/extras/82f42fa4a466ba1109320fe11f46ee60.webm?t=1787708313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2621760/extras/82f42fa4a466ba1109320fe11f46ee60.mp4?t=1787708313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
